---
import '../styles/services-styles/procedimientos.css'
import Imgdr from '../assets/dr-enriquez.png'

const procedures = [
    {
        id: "wholebody",
        label: "Whole-Body Hyperthermia",
        icon: `<svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 4v10.5a4 4 0 1 1-4 0V4a2 2 0 0 1 4 0z"></path></svg>`,
        facts: ["Complementary Therapy", "Administered by medical staff", "Combined with primary treatment plan"],
        img: Imgdr,
        // REVISAR: suavicé "may help inhibit cancer cell growth or stop their further growth" a lenguaje de soporte, sin claim mecanístico directo. Confirmar con equipo médico si se puede reintroducir la formulación original con evidencia que la sustente.
        html: `<p style="text-align: justify; margin:0;">
        <b>Whole-Body Hyperthermia (WBH)</b> is a complementary therapy used alongside treatment for cancer and other conditions such as Lyme Disease. In oncology, WBH uses an external heat source to raise tissue temperature as part of an integrative treatment plan.
        <br>
        The term 'hyperthermia' applies to the use of different techniques in combination with other cancer treatments (particularly chemotherapy and radiation therapy), always under medical supervision.
        <br><br>
        Cancer cells are known to have a higher metabolic rate than normal cells, which is part of why this therapy is used as a complementary approach. A few physiological characteristics are relevant to understanding how it's applied:
        <ul>
            <li><b>1)</b> Blood vessels within tumors have a limited ability to dilate to dissipate heat.</li>
            <li><b>2)</b> Blood vessels within tumors tend to be more tortuous, which can prolong intra-tumoral heat exposure compared to normal tissue.</li>
            <li><b>3)</b> Changes at the cellular level following heat exposure are an active area of clinical interest in integrative oncology.</li>
        </ul>
        </p>`
    },
    {
        id: "chelation",
        label: "Chelation Therapy",
        icon: `<svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"></circle><path d="M19.4 15a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 .33 1.82l.06.06a2 2 0 1 1-2.83 2.83l-.06-.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.82-.33 1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1 1.51V21a2 2 0 0 1-4 0v-.09A1.65 1.65 0 0 0 9 19.4a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.82.33l-.06.06a2 2 0 1 1-2.83-2.83l.06-.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 .33-1.82 1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.51-1H3a2 2 0 0 1 0-4h.09A1.65 1.65 0 0 0 4.6 9a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-.33-1.82l-.06-.06a2 2 0 1 1 2.83-2.83l.06.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1.82.33H9a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1-1.51V3a2 2 0 0 1 4 0v.09a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1 1.51 1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1.82-.33l.06-.06a2 2 0 1 1 2.83 2.83l-.06.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-.33 1.82V9a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1.51 1H21a2 2 0 0 1 0 4h-.09a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.51 1z"></path></svg>`,
        facts: ["Uses EDTA (synthetic amino acid)", "60+ years of clinical use for lead poisoning", "Combined with nutrition & detox support"],
        img: Imgdr,
        // REVISAR: eliminé por completo la mención de MS, Alzheimer's y autismo — la FDA ha tomado acción legal directa contra empresas que vinculan quelación con autismo. Este punto no debe reintroducirse sin respaldo clínico y revisión legal explícita.
        html: `<p style="text-align: justify; margin:0;">
        <b>Chelation (key-LAY-shun)</b> is the process of removing or eliminating toxic metals and minerals from the body. The most common and effective chelation process uses EDTA (ethylene diamine tetra-acetic acid), a synthetic amino acid that has been used for over 65 years to treat lead poisoning and to help clear plaque contributing to circulatory issues.
        <br><br>
        At our clinic, EDTA chelation is used in combination with proteolytic enzymes, detoxification support, nutrition, and immune system support, always as part of a broader, medically supervised plan.
        </p>`
    },
    {
        id: "anticancer",
        label: "Integrative Support Program",
        icon: `<svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20.84 4.61a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 0L12 5.67l-1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 7.78l1.06 1.06L12 21.23l7.78-7.78 1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0 0-7.78z"></path></svg>`,
        facts: ["8 sessions / 4 weeks (hyperthermia)", "8 sessions / 4 weeks (hyperbaric oxygen)", "Personalized combination protocol"],
        img: Imgdr,
        // REVISAR: renombré el tab de "Anti-Cancer Program" a "Integrative Support Program" — el nombre original es en sí un claim. Suavicé "smart bombs / target sick genetic twins" (ver Extracorporeal) y quité el detalle de dosis bajas de quimioterapia (IPT), ya que describir protocolo clínico específico en una página pública/compartible puede no ser apropiado — se las dejo abajo comentadas por si el equipo médico decide reintroducirlas de forma controlada.
        html: `<p style="text-align: justify; margin:0;">
        This integrative program combines several complementary approaches, including targeted nutritional support (vitamins, minerals, amino acids, antioxidants), whole-body hyperthermia <b>(8 sessions in 4 weeks)</b>, and hyperbaric oxygen therapy <b>(8 sessions in 4 weeks)</b>.
        <br><br>
        <b>Live-cell therapy</b> is offered to support immune function and the body's natural repair processes. We also provide the Alpha-2010 Spa System, which offers heat therapy, lymphatic massage, and detoxification support. Additional therapies, including stem cell support, are available on a case-by-case basis according to each patient's personalized plan.
        <!-- <p>IPT utilizando dosis bajas de quimioterapia también se ofrece a quienes lo solicitan — decisión pendiente del equipo médico sobre si incluir en página pública.</p> -->
        </p>`
    },
    {
        id: "stemcell",
        label: "Stem Cell Therapy",
        icon: `<svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="6" cy="6" r="3"></circle><circle cx="18" cy="6" r="3"></circle><circle cx="6" cy="18" r="3"></circle><circle cx="18" cy="18" r="3"></circle><path d="M9 6h6M6 9v6M18 9v6M9 18h6"></path></svg>`,
        facts: ["Uses patient's own cells", "Sourced from bone marrow or fat tissue", "Supports natural repair processes"],
        img: Imgdr,
        // REVISAR: suavicé "support the body in its fight against disease" a lenguaje de soporte funcional.
        html: `<p style="text-align: justify; margin:0;">
        <b>Stem cell therapy</b> is a regenerative medical procedure that draws on the body's own healing potential. Stem cells can develop into many different cell types — from muscle and bone to nerve and blood cells — acting as part of the body's natural repair system.
        <br><br>
        We believe in supporting the body's natural healing processes. Stem cell therapy aligns with this philosophy: the procedure involves collecting stem cells, often from the patient's own bone marrow or fat tissue, and reintroducing them into the body to help reduce inflammation, support tissue repair, and complement overall wellness.
        </p>`
    },
    {
        id: "autoimmune",
        label: "Autoimmune Disorder Therapy",
        icon: `<svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 2 3 7v6c0 5 4 9 9 9s9-4 9-9V7l-9-5z"></path></svg>`,
        facts: ["Personalized integrative approach", "US insurance liaison available", "Symptom & wellness support"],
        img: Imgdr,
        // REVISAR: suavicé "rectify the condition at its root" a lenguaje de abordaje integral, sin implicar corrección/cura definitiva.
        html: `<p style="text-align: justify; margin:0;">
        At our clinic, we apply the same integrative philosophy used in cancer care to support patients with autoimmune disorders — combining complementary treatments designed to support symptom management as part of a comprehensive, personalized plan.
        <br><br>
        We understand navigating insurance can be a challenge. Many policies cover second opinions or alternative treatments. Our US liaison is available to guide you step-by-step in filing a claim and understanding your coverage benefits.
        </p>`
    },
    {
        id: "extracorporeal",
        label: "Extracorporeal Photopheresis",
        icon: `<svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 2v4M12 18v4M4.93 4.93l2.83 2.83M16.24 16.24l2.83 2.83M2 12h4M18 12h4M4.93 19.07l2.83-2.83M16.24 7.76l2.83-2.83"></path><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4"></circle></svg>`,
        facts: ["Blood-based autologous procedure", "Personalized cell processing", "Administered under medical supervision"],
        img: Imgdr,
        // REVISAR: quité por completo el lenguaje "smart bombs" y "target their sick genetic twins" — framing militar/mecanístico de alto riesgo. Reescribí en términos descriptivos generales del procedimiento, sin claim de eficacia específico.
        html: `<p style="text-align: justify; margin:0;">
        Apheresis is a procedure where blood is drawn (similar to a blood donation) and processed to separate its components. Through the process of Extracorporeal Photopheresis (ECPP), select cells are used to develop an Autologous Dendritic Cell Vaccine (ADCV) — a personalized preparation made from the patient's own blood.
        <br><br>
        This autologous (self-derived) approach is part of our integrative program and is administered under close medical supervision as one component of a broader, personalized treatment plan.
        </p>`
    }
];
---

<section class="procedimientos">
    <div class="eyebrow-wrap">

    <span class="eyebrow">Our Procedures</span>
    </div>
    <h2>Your Journey to Wellness: <br>Our <span class="highlight-text">Holistic Treatment</span> Procedures</h2>
    <p>Our comprehensive procedures are meticulously designed to ensure every aspect of your well-being is addressed, from precise diagnostics to integrated therapies and ongoing support. We believe in transparency and collaboration, empowering you with a clear understanding of each step on your path to recovery and renewed health.</p>

    <div class="tabs-container">
        <div class="tab-buttons">
            {procedures.map((proc, i) => (
                <button class={`tab-btn ${i === 0 ? "active" : ""}`} data-tab={proc.id}>
                    <span class="tab-icon" set:html={proc.icon} />
                    <span>{proc.label}</span>
                </button>
            ))}
        </div>

        {procedures.map((proc, i) => (
            <div class={`tab-content ${i === 0 ? "active" : ""}`} id={proc.id}>
                <div class="tabp-grid">
                    <div class="tabp-image">
                        <img src={proc.img.src} width="100%" alt={proc.label} />
                    </div>
                    <div class="tabp-body">
                        <div class="fact-row">
                            {proc.facts.map((fact) => (
                                <span class="fact-chip">{fact}</span>
                            ))}
                        </div>
                        <div class="desc-proc" set:html={proc.html} />
                        <button class="share-btn" data-share-title={proc.label}>
                            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                                <circle cx="18" cy="5" r="3"></circle>
                                <circle cx="6" cy="12" r="3"></circle>
                                <circle cx="18" cy="19" r="3"></circle>
                                <path d="M8.6 13.5l6.8 3.9M15.4 6.6l-6.8 3.9"></path>
                            </svg>
                            Share this treatment
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        ))}

        <p class="disclaimer">
            These therapies are offered as complementary approaches designed to work alongside your primary medical treatment and are not a substitute for it. Individual results may vary. Please consult with our medical team to determine what's right for your specific situation.
        </p>
    </div>
</section>

<script>
    import "../scripts/paquetes.js"
</script>